ght front door lock geared motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237028\">N51A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4b</p></td><td><p>Right front door lock geared motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237030\">N51B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>4c</p></td><td><p>Right front door lock geared motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237032\">N51C</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2018988.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the lock is intact\nand undamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections.</p><p>Fit the catch.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><p>Connect the connecting rods on the lock\nside with the outer handle.</p><p>Check that the lock works by operating\nthe outer handle.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238596\">7005D24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238582\">7005C54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238558\">7005A04</a></p><p>Test the operation of the lock by operating\nthe inner handle.</p>"]]